   "stem": {
      "text": "The Maclaurin series for \\( f(x) = 6 \\arctan x \\) is \\( \\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty} 6 \\frac{(-1)^n x^{2n+1}}{2n+1} \\). Let \\( S_{4} = \\sum_{n=0}^{4} 6 \\frac{(-1)^n x^{2n+1}}{2n+1} \\) evaluated at \\( x = \\frac{5}{6} \\) approximate \\( f(\\frac{5}{6}) \\). Use the alternating series error bound to find the exact value of an upper bound for \\( \\left|f(\\frac{5}{6}) - S_{4}\\right| \\).",
